<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/lu_d30b2e95fb9d7d7778de8f39f87fde424e1edcdcec29e5931d37a4644749a1db_n0057/e_0002/normalization> <http://digistrucmed.org/normalizationMappingStatus> "UNMAPPED" .
