<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/lu_d30b2e95fb9d7d7778de8f39f87fde424e1edcdcec29e5931d37a4644749a1db_n0057/e_0023> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Participation in recreational exercise programmes of low to moderate intensity" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_d30b2e95fb9d7d7778de8f39f87fde424e1edcdcec29e5931d37a4644749a1db_n0057/tu_0002> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Participation in high-intensity exercise and all competitive sports, if desired, with the exception where syncope may cause serious harm or death, may be considered in asymptomatic individuals with LVNC and LVEF ≥ 50% and absence of frequent and/or complex VAs." .
<http://digistrucmed.org/semantic-unit/lu_d30b2e95fb9d7d7778de8f39f87fde424e1edcdcec29e5931d37a4644749a1db_n0057> <http://digistrucmed.org/physicalBlockId> "pb_d30b2e95fb9d7d7778de8f39f87fde424e1edcdcec29e5931d37a4644749a1db_p0043_g001" .
